                                "sense_id": "55ff153e-4d37-3382-a7d9-b4f9f152ded5",
                                "text": "It is easy to see that empire obtained by force is unrepublican and offensive to that first principle of our Union according to which all just government stands only on the consent of the governed."
                            },
